<title>ISRAEL: Bank of Israel lowers key rate 0.5 pct point.</title>
<headline>Bank of Israel lowers key rate 0.5 pct point.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Israel said it would lower its key lending rate for September by 0.5 percentage point to an annualised 15.8 percent.</p>
<p>The rate is one charged commercial banks at monetary tenders for daily and weekly loans.</p>
</text>
